---
alwaysApply: true
---
This is a pnpm + Turborepo monorepo. Apps live in apps/, shared code in packages/.
- Stack: React 18+, TypeScript (strict), Vite. No Next.js.
- Never install packages at the root unless they are dev tooling; use `pnpm --filter <app> add <pkg>`.
- Write small, typed components. No `any`. Use CSS Modules or plain CSS unless told otherwise.
- Do not modify files outside the app named in the prompt.
- After changes, make sure `pnpm --filter web build` passes.
- Explain briefly what you changed at the end.